(506821, 49826, 3087, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the title but the image is great. Absolutely the kind of study of shape and texture that I like (and take myself, though not as well as this). Great diagonal from corner to corner.</td>', 'Don''t like the title but the image is great. Absolutely the kind of study of shape and texture that I like (and take myself, though not as well as this). Great diagonal from corner to corner.', '2003-12-08 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
