(507226, 49818, 11793, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2003-12-08 18:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(507227, 49947, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject - it seems like a window display, but is it?  It is truely crips on the ribbon where it comes over the side of the big box, but everything else is out of focus.  It is that blurriness that looses the sense of the shapes in the picture.  I like your set up, balls and boxes, but I wish that the depth of focus were greater.</td>', 'Interesting subject - it seems like a window display, but is it?  It is truely crips on the ribbon where it comes over the side of the big box, but everything else is out of focus.  It is that blurriness that looses the sense of the shapes in the picture.  I like your set up, balls and boxes, but I wish that the depth of focus were greater.', '2003-12-08 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
