(507231, 49966, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the orange and greens colors together.  I''m not sure why you chose to have the stack of oranges (clementines?) in partial silouette, and have the well lit one in the background out of focus.  I do like the effect of the orange color creeping around the edges of the fruit, but the front is just too dark and the composition to disparate - I''n like the focus to be on one fruit, with the lighting effect done a bit better - it would really show the shape of the fruit.</td>', 'I like the orange and greens colors together.  I''m not sure why you chose to have the stack of oranges (clementines?) in partial silouette, and have the well lit one in the background out of focus.  I do like the effect of the orange color creeping around the edges of the fruit, but the front is just too dark and the composition to disparate - I''n like the focus to be on one fruit, with the lighting effect done a bit better - it would really show the shape of the fruit.', '2003-12-08 18:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(507232, 49971, 11793, '<td valign="top">cool lighting</td>', 'cool lighting', '2003-12-08 18:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
