(507377, 49960, 12611, '<td valign="top">This foot might be sexier in the shoe- with the heel tilted up. There''s not enough arch in this shot for my taste.</td>', 'This foot might be sexier in the shoe- with the heel tilted up. There''s not enough arch in this shot for my taste.', '2003-12-08 22:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
