(507381, 49884, 12611, '<td valign="top">The drops at the wide nouth are distracting- in order to sell the fact that wine is in the carafe,(or is it soda?) a deeper crimson needs to be portrayed. Either the back lighting is to strong, or the liquid is too thin. I like my wine carafe like i likes my women... thick in the neck and previously de-corked. :)</td>', 'The drops at the wide nouth are distracting- in order to sell the fact that wine is in the carafe,(or is it soda?) a deeper crimson needs to be portrayed. Either the back lighting is to strong, or the liquid is too thin. I like my wine carafe like i likes my women... thick in the neck and previously de-corked. :)', '2003-12-08 22:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(507382, 49849, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  Like the colors as well.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  Like the colors as well.', '2003-12-08 22:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(507383, 49977, 14001, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!  Excellent colors.</td>', 'Very nice composition!  Excellent colors.', '2003-12-08 22:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(507384, 49810, 12611, '<td valign="top">Pictures of white satellite dishes are generally a cold subject. I almost get your title... In my opinion, The sky needs definition... a color, a texture something. I do like the shadow denoting a morning sunrise on the building.</td>', 'Pictures of white satellite dishes are generally a cold subject. I almost get your title... In my opinion, The sky needs definition... a color, a texture something. I do like the shadow denoting a morning sunrise on the building.', '2003-12-08 22:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
