(507388, 49955, 12611, '<td valign="top">I''m not so keen on the speckling. The title would be better as "My Home planet... Mars" or something like that. I do like the tiffany lamp style ornament though...</td>', 'I''m not so keen on the speckling. The title would be better as "My Home planet... Mars" or something like that. I do like the tiffany lamp style ornament though...', '2003-12-08 22:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
