(507392, 49982, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this. I hate those shadows. 3 points off for those buggy looking shadows. I love the glass kieth haring shape people. this would be a ten without those blasted shadows.</td>', 'I like this. I hate those shadows. 3 points off for those buggy looking shadows. I love the glass kieth haring shape people. this would be a ten without those blasted shadows.', '2003-12-08 22:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
