(507415, 49933, 10275, '<td valign="top">OK, which colour of ribbon do you prefer for this image? It''s really beautiful. Love the contrast of the shadows, love the way it interacts with the blue sky. I wouldn''t change a thing. Just perfect.</td>', 'OK, which colour of ribbon do you prefer for this image? It''s really beautiful. Love the contrast of the shadows, love the way it interacts with the blue sky. I wouldn''t change a thing. Just perfect.', '2003-12-08 23:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
