(507418, 49816, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely shapes. Great backlighting, you managed to keep the highlights nicely and show the texture in the same time. Very well done.</td>', 'Lovely shapes. Great backlighting, you managed to keep the highlights nicely and show the texture in the same time. Very well done.', '2003-12-08 23:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(507419, 49707, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very impressive composition. Beautifully done in b&amp;w. The shape really makes this shot stand out among the others.</td>', 'Very impressive composition. Beautifully done in b&w. The shape really makes this shot stand out among the others.', '2003-12-08 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(507421, 49782, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful curves and flow. Colours enhance this visual fantasy. Good simple background. It just looks a bit pixelated, which could be easily fixed (maybe higher compression quality of the JPG.)</td>', 'Beautiful curves and flow. Colours enhance this visual fantasy. Good simple background. It just looks a bit pixelated, which could be easily fixed (maybe higher compression quality of the JPG.)', '2003-12-08 23:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(507422, 49826, 6405, '<td valign="top">WOW,WOW,10  from me!</td>', 'WOW,WOW,10  from me!', '2003-12-08 23:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(507423, 49783, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful,10 here!</td>', 'Beautiful,10 here!', '2003-12-08 23:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(507425, 49960, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely perfect for this challenge. The shape really makes this shot. It''s simple, yet beautiful. This is definitely my #1. I hope you score well.</td>', 'This is absolutely perfect for this challenge. The shape really makes this shot. It''s simple, yet beautiful. This is definitely my #1. I hope you score well.', '2003-12-08 23:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(507428, 49826, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of sidelighting. Gorgeous image. Great perspective and depth of field. My only negative point is that the sand is a bit pixelated (oversharpened) and also I am not so sure about the greenish tone. Still, very beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful use of sidelighting. Gorgeous image. Great perspective and depth of field. My only negative point is that the sand is a bit pixelated (oversharpened) and also I am not so sure about the greenish tone. Still, very beautiful shot.', '2003-12-08 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(507429, 49937, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful abstract photo. Love the subtle blue tones on the right side that contrast with the sharp centre bubbled texture. It will definitely become part of my favourites. My only suggestion in this case would have been to cleen up the bubbles from the right side bluish semicirle area as that space is nice and smooth (which in this challenge would have been legal). But that''s just nitpicking, overall great photo.</td>', 'Very beautiful abstract photo. Love the subtle blue tones on the right side that contrast with the sharp centre bubbled texture. It will definitely become part of my favourites. My only suggestion in this case would have been to cleen up the bubbles from the right side bluish semicirle area as that space is nice and smooth (which in this challenge would have been legal). But that''s just nitpicking, overall great photo.', '2003-12-08 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(507431, 49890, 10275, '<td valign="top">This definitely caught my attention. Great use of lighting to produce abstract piece of art. Love the golden tones and the textured top of the image with soft bottom. Great shot.</td>', 'This definitely caught my attention. Great use of lighting to produce abstract piece of art. Love the golden tones and the textured top of the image with soft bottom. Great shot.', '2003-12-08 23:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(507432, 49642, 10275, '<td valign="top">I am trying really hard, but I do not see the reflections you mention in your title. It looks a bit underexposed and has a yellowish cast. The shape itself is nice, but the image as a whole is not interesting enough for the shape to make any impact.</td>', 'I am trying really hard, but I do not see the reflections you mention in your title. It looks a bit underexposed and has a yellowish cast. The shape itself is nice, but the image as a whole is not interesting enough for the shape to make any impact.', '2003-12-08 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(507434, 49514, 10275, '<td valign="top">You will probably get many comments on the yellow text over your image. It is really oooops you should try to avoid. You could have edit it out in this challenge (it was legal). The object is interesting, but has way too much space around it for it to really stand out. I would suggest moving closer or zooming in a bit towards the top. Image could also use a bit of brightening.</td>', 'You will probably get many comments on the yellow text over your image. It is really oooops you should try to avoid. You could have edit it out in this challenge (it was legal). The object is interesting, but has way too much space around it for it to really stand out. I would suggest moving closer or zooming in a bit towards the top. Image could also use a bit of brightening.', '2003-12-08 23:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(507436, 49950, 10275, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, you got a shape. But the image is out of focus (you got too close to it and your camera probably cannot focus in such a small distance from your object). Also give your shape more space around so it can stand out. Did you try to blow this up? It looks pixelated. Colour is nice.</td>', 'Challenge met, you got a shape. But the image is out of focus (you got too close to it and your camera probably cannot focus in such a small distance from your object). Also give your shape more space around so it can stand out. Did you try to blow this up? It looks pixelated. Colour is nice.', '2003-12-08 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(507439, 49323, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. Great colour contrasts. But my eyes are going around the blurry area in the centre a bit. Did you try to soften this on purpose? It could have worked all sharp as well. Also I am not too keen on centred composition.</td>', 'Interesting concept. Great colour contrasts. But my eyes are going around the blurry area in the centre a bit. Did you try to soften this on purpose? It could have worked all sharp as well. Also I am not too keen on centred composition.', '2003-12-08 23:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(507440, 49787, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic photo. But IMO you went a bit too far in the post processing with this. Sometimes less is more. The blue ball stands out nicely against the dramatic surroundings, but it is almost distorted by pixelation. The colour looks strange (the greenish part). I''ve seen fractals before, but in your image I cannot really make the connection - it looks more like chaos (fractals are highly organized). Overall, not bad image, it caught enough of my attention.</td>', 'Very dramatic photo. But IMO you went a bit too far in the post processing with this. Sometimes less is more. The blue ball stands out nicely against the dramatic surroundings, but it is almost distorted by pixelation. The colour looks strange (the greenish part). I''ve seen fractals before, but in your image I cannot really make the connection - it looks more like chaos (fractals are highly organized). Overall, not bad image, it caught enough of my attention.', '2003-12-08 23:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(507444, 49969, 10275, '<td valign="top">You got many shapes, but they don''t really make the image any better. You could have picked one of the ornaments and explore that in more depth. Simplify. The colours are nice, but your photo is a bit pixelated. The snow looks greish blue (if that''s a snow). Also the crop is a bit too tight. Give your object more breathing space.</td>', 'You got many shapes, but they don''t really make the image any better. You could have picked one of the ornaments and explore that in more depth. Simplify. The colours are nice, but your photo is a bit pixelated. The snow looks greish blue (if that''s a snow). Also the crop is a bit too tight. Give your object more breathing space.', '2003-12-08 23:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(507449, 49988, 10275, '<td valign="top">This photo looks very busy to me. Maybe isolating one or two of the triangles could have helped to simplify it enough to stand out in terms of shape and composition. The way it is now, it''s hard to find a spot to rest your eyes on. It''s not abstract enough, but I cannot guess what it is at all.</td>', 'This photo looks very busy to me. Maybe isolating one or two of the triangles could have helped to simplify it enough to stand out in terms of shape and composition. The way it is now, it''s hard to find a spot to rest your eyes on. It''s not abstract enough, but I cannot guess what it is at all.', '2003-12-08 23:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(507452, 49638, 10275, '<td valign="top">Your photo is nicely colourful and main subject is sharp, but it looks a bit tacky to mee. I know you were going for a Christmas theme here, but the two lights on the left have nothing to do with your main object, so the shape doesn''t really stand out here. As for post processing, I would have cloned out the harsh glow on the bottom below the lights. Maybe simpler background would have helped to bring attention to your happy face shape.</td>', 'Your photo is nicely colourful and main subject is sharp, but it looks a bit tacky to mee. I know you were going for a Christmas theme here, but the two lights on the left have nothing to do with your main object, so the shape doesn''t really stand out here. As for post processing, I would have cloned out the harsh glow on the bottom below the lights. Maybe simpler background would have helped to bring attention to your happy face shape.', '2003-12-08 23:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(507455, 49872, 10275, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of potential, but it has few bugs that could be improved upon. The grain here is on purpose I guess, but it kind of kills the shape. Also it apears too horizontal. Perhaps positioning the body on an angle with just the bikini and legs showing to make it more abstract flow of shapes. Also since we are alowed to spot edit this challenge, you could have cloned out the specs on the bottom of the right leg. Great effort.</td>', 'This image has a lot of potential, but it has few bugs that could be improved upon. The grain here is on purpose I guess, but it kind of kills the shape. Also it apears too horizontal. Perhaps positioning the body on an angle with just the bikini and legs showing to make it more abstract flow of shapes. Also since we are alowed to spot edit this challenge, you could have cloned out the specs on the bottom of the right leg. Great effort.', '2003-12-08 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(507456, 49701, 5534, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting. I don''t know if is caused by the shadows, but it look as though there is a slight slope going left to right on where the ball is resting.</td>', 'Great use of lighting. I don''t know if is caused by the shadows, but it look as though there is a slight slope going left to right on where the ball is resting.', '2003-12-08 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(507457, 49469, 10275, '<td valign="top">You have too many things happening in your shot. The backlighting is interesting, but the image is so busy that the viewer doesn''t know what to make of it. Perhaps simplifying or different arrangement of the objects could improve your image. Also you could use the cloning tool to clean up some of the specs on the glass (legal in this case).</td>', 'You have too many things happening in your shot. The backlighting is interesting, but the image is so busy that the viewer doesn''t know what to make of it. Perhaps simplifying or different arrangement of the objects could improve your image. Also you could use the cloning tool to clean up some of the specs on the glass (legal in this case).', '2003-12-08 23:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(507461, 49625, 5534, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and great textures. I wouldn''t mind seeing a colored version after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Nice angle and great textures. I wouldn''t mind seeing a colored version after the challenge is over.', '2003-12-08 23:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(507463, 49759, 10275, '<td valign="top">I quite don''t know what to make of this shot. The magnifying glass doesn''t really add much to the image, since it didn''t actually magnify anything. It just looks like it''s in the way of showing the silly glasses. The expression in the boy''s face has no emotion, so it is not very fun to look at. Could use some overall sharpening as well.</td>', 'I quite don''t know what to make of this shot. The magnifying glass doesn''t really add much to the image, since it didn''t actually magnify anything. It just looks like it''s in the way of showing the silly glasses. The expression in the boy''s face has no emotion, so it is not very fun to look at. Could use some overall sharpening as well.', '2003-12-08 23:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(507466, 49966, 10275, '<td valign="top">If you are trying to show healthy shapes, why not illuminate them all. Why throw the front of the image into darkness which leads your eyes to the more lit object that is out of focus. It kind of kills the purpose of the front shapes. It is a bit too tightly cropped on the left. Unless the greenish cast was intended, it doesn''t really work here. The oranges are reddish, why not use blue or yellower background or lighting.</td>', 'If you are trying to show healthy shapes, why not illuminate them all. Why throw the front of the image into darkness which leads your eyes to the more lit object that is out of focus. It kind of kills the purpose of the front shapes. It is a bit too tightly cropped on the left. Unless the greenish cast was intended, it doesn''t really work here. The oranges are reddish, why not use blue or yellower background or lighting.', '2003-12-09 00:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(507488, 49869, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image and a good idea</td>', 'Nice clear image and a good idea', '2003-12-09 00:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
