(507509, 49758, 4494, '<td valign="top">I''m giving high marks for abstract shapes like this, where you can''t tell what the object is.   One thing is, use Neat Image or Despeckle, etc., to remove the graineness from it.  This would be awesome if the white to black were perfectly smooth.</td>', 'I''m giving high marks for abstract shapes like this, where you can''t tell what the object is.   One thing is, use Neat Image or Despeckle, etc., to remove the graineness from it.  This would be awesome if the white to black were perfectly smooth.', '2003-12-09 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
