(507691, 49976, 2553, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it.  Just enough information to enable you to make out the shape, and I love that you used the colors to sort of separate elements of the subject.  On an emotional level, this shot has moderate impact for me, but I do find it interesting to look at.</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it.  Just enough information to enable you to make out the shape, and I love that you used the colors to sort of separate elements of the subject.  On an emotional level, this shot has moderate impact for me, but I do find it interesting to look at.', '2003-12-09 05:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(507695, 49921, 2553, '<td valign="top">My first thought with this was, "What a very odd photo!"  Those globes are so BIG, and she is so small.  I find this shot appealing from several angles:  the very "otherworldly" feel of it; the decision to keep only the delightful pink as the "color" element; and the juxtaposition of the tiny girl and the giant globes.  I think this shot would have much more impact for me if the background was blurred.  It is just "busy" enough that it distracts.  This photo makes me wish it was a 360 shot so I could look around and see where the heck am I, and what the heck are these big globes doing here anyway??!!  8</td>', 'My first thought with this was, "What a very odd photo!"  Those globes are so BIG, and she is so small.  I find this shot appealing from several angles:  the very "otherworldly" feel of it; the decision to keep only the delightful pink as the "color" element; and the juxtaposition of the tiny girl and the giant globes.  I think this shot would have much more impact for me if the background was blurred.  It is just "busy" enough that it distracts.  This photo makes me wish it was a 360 shot so I could look around and see where the heck am I, and what the heck are these big globes doing here anyway??!!  8', '2003-12-09 05:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(507698, 49849, 2553, '<td valign="top">The major dark and light areas of this shot create a powerful abstract composition.  I would really like to see that small light piece that is sticking up into the dark area cloned out.  It really distracts from the strength of the composition of the overall shot.</td>', 'The major dark and light areas of this shot create a powerful abstract composition.  I would really like to see that small light piece that is sticking up into the dark area cloned out.  It really distracts from the strength of the composition of the overall shot.', '2003-12-09 05:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(507699, 49846, 2553, '<td valign="top">This I like.  A simple, elegant presentation of shape.  Beautiful lighting.</td>', 'This I like.  A simple, elegant presentation of shape.  Beautiful lighting.', '2003-12-09 05:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(507700, 49896, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot, especially the "white on white" aspect of presenting shape.  However, I find that the composition is not dynamic enough to be visually engaging for very long.  I think that having another chess piece in the shot to create some visual tension would create more interest, and for my taste, would make a more powerful shot.</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot, especially the "white on white" aspect of presenting shape.  However, I find that the composition is not dynamic enough to be visually engaging for very long.  I think that having another chess piece in the shot to create some visual tension would create more interest, and for my taste, would make a more powerful shot.', '2003-12-09 05:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(507701, 49323, 2553, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft for me, for this shot, and would like to have seen more even lighting.  That being said, I like the color, and the abstract nature of this shot.  Though the shot does not show clearly defined shapes of "objects", it does use the color to define some shapes, and from that aspect, meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft for me, for this shot, and would like to have seen more even lighting.  That being said, I like the color, and the abstract nature of this shot.  Though the shot does not show clearly defined shapes of "objects", it does use the color to define some shapes, and from that aspect, meets the challenge well.', '2003-12-09 05:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(507702, 49525, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m definitely not going to win anything on guessing what these are!  They look like some kind of button to me.  An interesting, visually engaging shot, and I like the black and white, though I tend to like a wider tonal range.  I think a different lighting angle, creating some interesting darker tones would make a more powerful composition.</td>', 'I''m definitely not going to win anything on guessing what these are!  They look like some kind of button to me.  An interesting, visually engaging shot, and I like the black and white, though I tend to like a wider tonal range.  I think a different lighting angle, creating some interesting darker tones would make a more powerful composition.', '2003-12-09 05:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(507703, 49917, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting for the presentation of shape!  Creates a very strong visual appeal.  The "fade to black" use of negative space is very nice, and the composition has a great "flow" to it that carries the eye throughout the shot.</td>', 'Nice lighting for the presentation of shape!  Creates a very strong visual appeal.  The "fade to black" use of negative space is very nice, and the composition has a great "flow" to it that carries the eye throughout the shot.', '2003-12-09 06:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(507708, 49989, 13749, '<td valign="top">i think a different perspective and crop that didn''t include the trees would have made this a bit more powerful and fitting to the title.  if you happen to agree with my opinion, i think it would be worth the effort to reshoot - it''s a good idea.</td>', 'i think a different perspective and crop that didn''t include the trees would have made this a bit more powerful and fitting to the title.  if you happen to agree with my opinion, i think it would be worth the effort to reshoot - it''s a good idea.', '2003-12-09 06:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(507710, 49959, 13749, '<td valign="top">in my opinion, it would be slightly stronger if they were more level, and if the shadow underneath the bottom one were visible.  also, i don''t think the black border works too well with the subject, but who knows.</td>', 'in my opinion, it would be slightly stronger if they were more level, and if the shadow underneath the bottom one were visible.  also, i don''t think the black border works too well with the subject, but who knows.', '2003-12-09 06:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(507711, 49917, 13749, '<td valign="top">in light of the last challenge - some soft focus here might have helped.. a little too much detail in the skin for me.</td>', 'in light of the last challenge - some soft focus here might have helped.. a little too much detail in the skin for me.', '2003-12-09 06:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
