(507721, 49849, 3445, '<td valign="top">Compelling.  Then you ask why and you see that the composition is using all the things we were once taught.  Very nice.</td>', 'Compelling.  Then you ask why and you see that the composition is using all the things we were once taught.  Very nice.', '2003-12-09 06:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
