(508073, 49879, 2843, '<td valign="top">Wondeful shot! I can''t imagine how long it must have taken to get this one right. Composition is excellent. Could be a tad brighter and less grainy, but thats a lot to ask considering the film and shutter speeds you must have been using.</td>', 'Wondeful shot! I can''t imagine how long it must have taken to get this one right. Composition is excellent. Could be a tad brighter and less grainy, but thats a lot to ask considering the film and shutter speeds you must have been using.', '2003-12-09 15:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
