(508078, 49969, 2843, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but it could be better. While numerous shapes are present it just doesn''t shout shape to me. The crop is too tight which makes it feel cramped. Maybe a closer more dramatic angle would be better, or more negative space with basket placement following the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but it could be better. While numerous shapes are present it just doesn''t shout shape to me. The crop is too tight which makes it feel cramped. Maybe a closer more dramatic angle would be better, or more negative space with basket placement following the rule of thirds.', '2003-12-09 15:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(508094, 49967, 13749, '<td valign="top">looks so fake - not sure why.. i think it\''s the textures.  makes it hard to believe that this is more photograph than photoshop, but i\''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'looks so fake - not sure why.. i think it\''s the textures.  makes it hard to believe that this is more photograph than photoshop, but i\''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2003-12-09 15:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(508098, 49908, 13749, '<td valign="top">i really like the idea, but wonder if a perspective without the trees would have been possible.  also, unless buses (or trailers?) are common, it might\''ve been nice to reshoot it without the taillights of the tall vehicle streaking through the middle, imho.</td>', 'i really like the idea, but wonder if a perspective without the trees would have been possible.  also, unless buses (or trailers?) are common, it might\''ve been nice to reshoot it without the taillights of the tall vehicle streaking through the middle, imho.', '2003-12-09 16:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(508106, 49971, 13749, '<td valign="top">very beautiful lighting and approach to the shot, although i''m not quite sure i like the border.</td>', 'very beautiful lighting and approach to the shot, although i''m not quite sure i like the border.', '2003-12-09 16:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(508108, 49948, 13749, '<td valign="top">creative perspective, as i\''m guessing this is truly just a rectangular building of some sort (or am i wrong?).  despite the wonderful perspective involved, it just doesn\''t really catch my eye though.  unfortunately, i think it\''s a result of the bland sky.  i guess with these winter months, gray skies are about all many people have to work with anymore.</td>', 'creative perspective, as i\''m guessing this is truly just a rectangular building of some sort (or am i wrong?).  despite the wonderful perspective involved, it just doesn\''t really catch my eye though.  unfortunately, i think it\''s a result of the bland sky.  i guess with these winter months, gray skies are about all many people have to work with anymore.', '2003-12-09 16:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(508109, 49540, 13749, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i think the birds add a LOT to this photo, as it wouldn''t be quite as expressive without them.</td>', 'very nice.  i think the birds add a LOT to this photo, as it wouldn''t be quite as expressive without them.', '2003-12-09 16:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
