(508229, 49912, 9982, '<td valign="top">Great pic, shame about the spelling. [7]</td>', 'Great pic, shame about the spelling. [7]', '2003-12-09 18:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(508268, 49950, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot relies too heavily on a material shape rather than generating intrigue through the photograph itself. <br/> <br/>What I mean is - it''s dull because everything is just there right in front of you. No angles, lighting, focus or creativity using the medium. I''m very sorry to sound negative but if you look at the others out there they''re generating interest from unusual vantage points and a considered composition. Don''t get discourage though - just learn from the masters!  ;)</td>', 'This shot relies too heavily on a material shape rather than generating intrigue through the photograph itself.  What I mean is - it''s dull because everything is just there right in front of you. No angles, lighting, focus or creativity using the medium. I''m very sorry to sound negative but if you look at the others out there they''re generating interest from unusual vantage points and a considered composition. Don''t get discourage though - just learn from the masters!  ;)', '2003-12-09 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(508273, 49962, 8860, '<td valign="top">That''s a bitter sentiment! Hope all is well.  ;/ <br/> <br/>I don''t think the space in this shot helps. It leaves me wanting to see the ring in much more detail, filling the frame.</td>', 'That''s a bitter sentiment! Hope all is well.  ;/  I don''t think the space in this shot helps. It leaves me wanting to see the ring in much more detail, filling the frame.', '2003-12-09 19:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(508280, 49634, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love the moon and you''ve done well here. I would have desaturated the blue/cyan in your image though as the halo around it is distracting. You could have made it mono too.<br/> <br/>Great to see it so close up.</td>', 'I love the moon and you''ve done well here. I would have desaturated the blue/cyan in your image though as the halo around it is distracting. You could have made it mono too. Great to see it so close up.', '2003-12-09 19:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
