(509758, 49869, 6870, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is a good choice here as curves are generally soft. I kind of wish the curves were more clearly communicated. I like the image overall. Nice lighting and the face and guitar work well together.</td>', 'The soft focus is a good choice here as curves are generally soft. I kind of wish the curves were more clearly communicated. I like the image overall. Nice lighting and the face and guitar work well together.', '2003-12-10 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
