(509765, 49905, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely, soft shadows. Nice abstract!</td>', 'Lovely, soft shadows. Nice abstract!', '2003-12-10 15:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(509768, 49973, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W! Composition is interesting and keeps me on edge. One would normally allow room in front of the open end of the pod, or toward where it is leaning. Since you don''t do that, the image gives me an edgy, artistic feel.</td>', 'Nice B/W! Composition is interesting and keeps me on edge. One would normally allow room in front of the open end of the pod, or toward where it is leaning. Since you don''t do that, the image gives me an edgy, artistic feel.', '2003-12-10 15:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(509769, 49701, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ball and diagonal lines contrast nicely!</td>', 'Ball and diagonal lines contrast nicely!', '2003-12-10 15:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(509774, 49818, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! General visual clarity is pretty good. Communicative clarity is great! To add some ''zip'' to this, experiment with the angles of the shadows (it''s fairly horizontal now), and perhaps point of view. Using diagonals will add some drama, and the point of view could help, too.</td>', 'Clever idea! General visual clarity is pretty good. Communicative clarity is great! To add some ''zip'' to this, experiment with the angles of the shadows (it''s fairly horizontal now), and perhaps point of view. Using diagonals will add some drama, and the point of view could help, too.', '2003-12-10 16:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(509778, 49508, 6870, '<td valign="top">The white background works to set this badge off and make it really get focus, but you might also try experimenting with putting the badge in some kind of context, too.</td>', 'The white background works to set this badge off and make it really get focus, but you might also try experimenting with putting the badge in some kind of context, too.', '2003-12-10 16:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
