(512395, 49782, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern of lights; but kind of busy and hard to pick a focal point.</td>', 'Interesting pattern of lights; but kind of busy and hard to pick a focal point.', '2003-12-13 22:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(512396, 49890, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great concept, and an interesting shape. I think the slats and molding in the ceiling detracts from the overall effect - it becomes more of a subject than the mushroom shape.</td>', 'Great concept, and an interesting shape. I think the slats and molding in the ceiling detracts from the overall effect - it becomes more of a subject than the mushroom shape.', '2003-12-13 22:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(512398, 49256, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting collection of shapes, but it''s ambiguous,  and I''m not really sure how to relate it to the title.</td>', 'An interesting collection of shapes, but it''s ambiguous,  and I''m not really sure how to relate it to the title.', '2003-12-13 22:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(512400, 49876, 12733, '<td valign="top">Simplicity, yes; great lighting and texture representation, yes, but in the end, it''s still just an egg with a lot of space around it.</td>', 'Simplicity, yes; great lighting and texture representation, yes, but in the end, it''s still just an egg with a lot of space around it.', '2003-12-13 22:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(512402, 49987, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shape as a frame, rather than the center of the photo. It takes enough of the space to become a subject, while the portrait and the building in the background form an interesting picture in themselves. Was the circular piece created for the photo? Was it there for some other purpose? Or was it added in post production (though the way the kid''s arm is resting on it makes that seem unlikely).</td>', 'Nice use of shape as a frame, rather than the center of the photo. It takes enough of the space to become a subject, while the portrait and the building in the background form an interesting picture in themselves. Was the circular piece created for the photo? Was it there for some other purpose? Or was it added in post production (though the way the kid''s arm is resting on it makes that seem unlikely).', '2003-12-13 22:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(512403, 49727, 12733, '<td valign="top">The way the shapes of the glasses interact at the overlap points is ingeresting. I''d have liked to see more light on the bases, they seem to get lost in the black background.</td>', 'The way the shapes of the glasses interact at the overlap points is ingeresting. I''d have liked to see more light on the bases, they seem to get lost in the black background.', '2003-12-13 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(512405, 49880, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the metallic textures. I think a bit more depth of field would improve this shot as the colored panel could lead the viewer more into the picture.</td>', 'I like the capture of the metallic textures. I think a bit more depth of field would improve this shot as the colored panel could lead the viewer more into the picture.', '2003-12-13 22:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(512407, 49938, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture on the transluscence of the marbles and the reflections. This would also be a winner in the "soft focus" challenge for the way you bring the viewer directly to the one sharply focused item in the line.</td>', 'Great capture on the transluscence of the marbles and the reflections. This would also be a winner in the "soft focus" challenge for the way you bring the viewer directly to the one sharply focused item in the line.', '2003-12-13 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(512412, 49967, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great concept, and a nice use of ordinary objects to create a great abstraction. I think this is an exception to the general rule that you shouldn''t center a subject; I tried cropping with sheets of paper and it looked a lot better to me centered on a square background.</td>', 'Great concept, and a nice use of ordinary objects to create a great abstraction. I think this is an exception to the general rule that you shouldn''t center a subject; I tried cropping with sheets of paper and it looked a lot better to me centered on a square background.', '2003-12-13 22:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(512413, 49881, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the shadows make this rather mundane subject into an interesting picture.</td>', 'The lighting and the shadows make this rather mundane subject into an interesting picture.', '2003-12-13 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(512415, 49970, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, sharp focus and lighting. The ball really stands out despite the busy background.</td>', 'Nice composition, sharp focus and lighting. The ball really stands out despite the busy background.', '2003-12-13 22:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(512417, 49787, 12733, '<td valign="top">The bright touch of color in the midst of all this black and white gives this photo a three dimensional effect, and makes it jump right off the screen. Great work.</td>', 'The bright touch of color in the midst of all this black and white gives this photo a three dimensional effect, and makes it jump right off the screen. Great work.', '2003-12-13 22:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(512419, 49924, 12733, '<td valign="top">The architect and builder created an eye-catching collection of shapes. You captured it perfectly.</td>', 'The architect and builder created an eye-catching collection of shapes. You captured it perfectly.', '2003-12-13 22:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(512421, 49884, 12733, '<td valign="top">Say what??? The resemblance to a woman is kind of remote. I kind of like the overall shape and capture of the texture, but I think the color is unreal. I can see what you''re trying to accomplish, but it doesn''t come together for me.</td>', 'Say what??? The resemblance to a woman is kind of remote. I kind of like the overall shape and capture of the texture, but I think the color is unreal. I can see what you''re trying to accomplish, but it doesn''t come together for me.', '2003-12-13 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(512422, 49939, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty depiction of the moon; I especially like the luminescent quality.</td>', 'Very pretty depiction of the moon; I especially like the luminescent quality.', '2003-12-13 22:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(512425, 49856, 10402, '<td valign="top">The shape of the negative space is as interesting as the shape of the subject. Very nice!</td>', 'The shape of the negative space is as interesting as the shape of the subject. Very nice!', '2003-12-13 22:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(512426, 49490, 12733, '<td valign="top">To my eye, this is more about textures and shading than about shape, but eye-catching, well lighted and nicely composed.</td>', 'To my eye, this is more about textures and shading than about shape, but eye-catching, well lighted and nicely composed.', '2003-12-13 22:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(512427, 49525, 13077, '<td valign="top">Casts for making little wheels for mini replicas of cars?</td>', 'Casts for making little wheels for mini replicas of cars?', '2003-12-13 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(512428, 49947, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, the packages and balls seem to glow. The curtain seems out of place among the other items.</td>', 'Nice lighting, the packages and balls seem to glow. The curtain seems out of place among the other items.', '2003-12-13 22:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(512429, 49758, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition, great lighting and I really like the textured background.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition, great lighting and I really like the textured background.', '2003-12-13 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(512432, 49908, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the night lights. What is the wheel?</td>', 'Great capture of the night lights. What is the wheel?', '2003-12-13 22:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(512433, 49789, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great light refraction and an interesting cube. What is it?</td>', 'Great light refraction and an interesting cube. What is it?', '2003-12-13 22:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(512434, 49710, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sometimes less is more. The tight crop on part of the mando brings out the texture of wood and metal, the shape of the f-slot and a hint of the shape of the body. I like this better than the shots of entire instruments that were submitted.</td>', 'Sometimes less is more. The tight crop on part of the mando brings out the texture of wood and metal, the shape of the f-slot and a hint of the shape of the body. I like this better than the shots of entire instruments that were submitted.', '2003-12-13 22:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(512437, 49907, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the ice. The cluttered (but nicely unfocused) background makes sense once I read the title.</td>', 'I like the ice. The cluttered (but nicely unfocused) background makes sense once I read the title.', '2003-12-13 22:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(512438, 49906, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty composition, and I like the way the light comes through the leaf.</td>', 'Very pretty composition, and I like the way the light comes through the leaf.', '2003-12-13 22:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(512439, 49633, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the metallic shine and texture. Great choice of background color for this subject, and interesting use of negative space - the area between the two jugs looks like a heart shape.</td>', 'Nice capture of the metallic shine and texture. Great choice of background color for this subject, and interesting use of negative space - the area between the two jugs looks like a heart shape.', '2003-12-13 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(512442, 49979, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition of the curved shape. Covering the nude with the guitar and mask makes it more an abstract shape than a body. It works well. The lightness on the left side is a bit distracting; I wish the shadow went past the edge of the frame..</td>', 'Nice repetition of the curved shape. Covering the nude with the guitar and mask makes it more an abstract shape than a body. It works well. The lightness on the left side is a bit distracting; I wish the shadow went past the edge of the frame..', '2003-12-13 22:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(512445, 49977, 2333, '<td valign="top">A beautiful architectural abstract, one of my favorite images for this challenge. It could stand just a bit more saturation &amp; contrast; try bringing in the white and black points just a bit in levels, and adjusting midtone pointer to right to increase contrast slightly. The resulting slightly darker, more saturated image seems to my eye a slight improvement on an already exceptional image.</td>', 'A beautiful architectural abstract, one of my favorite images for this challenge. It could stand just a bit more saturation & contrast; try bringing in the white and black points just a bit in levels, and adjusting midtone pointer to right to increase contrast slightly. The resulting slightly darker, more saturated image seems to my eye a slight improvement on an already exceptional image.', '2003-12-13 23:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(512448, 49914, 10402, '<td valign="top">The assortment of small leaves is nicely arranged to complement the large leaf. They don''t detract from it, but keep it from being too stark.</td>', 'The assortment of small leaves is nicely arranged to complement the large leaf. They don''t detract from it, but keep it from being too stark.', '2003-12-13 23:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(512449, 49826, 2333, '<td valign="top">Spot on fit for the challenge adn very well executed. One of my favorites for this challenge.  I very much like the tones, exposure is spot on, nice comp, what''s more to say?</td>', 'Spot on fit for the challenge adn very well executed. One of my favorites for this challenge.  I very much like the tones, exposure is spot on, nice comp, what''s more to say?', '2003-12-13 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(512452, 49879, 2333, '<td valign="top">A techical standout. Perfect DoF, framing. Nice use of selective color. Would have worked well for simplicity as well, IMO</td>', 'A techical standout. Perfect DoF, framing. Nice use of selective color. Would have worked well for simplicity as well, IMO', '2003-12-13 23:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(512454, 49803, 10402, '<td valign="top">The spotlight effect works well, although for me the shadows are too stark.</td>', 'The spotlight effect works well, although for me the shadows are too stark.', '2003-12-13 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(512456, 49704, 2333, '<td valign="top">Holy Fork!... uh, I mean, what a monstrous shadow!<br/>I like your choice of composition, think I would have gone cooler on the colors, but that''s just my first impression. One of my favorites this challenge, a very original and well-executed idea.</td>', 'Holy Fork!... uh, I mean, what a monstrous shadow!I like your choice of composition, think I would have gone cooler on the colors, but that''s just my first impression. One of my favorites this challenge, a very original and well-executed idea.', '2003-12-13 23:13:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(512457, 49890, 2333, '<td valign="top">Perfect for for this challenge, very original. Is the light on a wall or a floor?</td>', 'Perfect for for this challenge, very original. Is the light on a wall or a floor?', '2003-12-13 23:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(512460, 49880, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp contrasty image. I think it cold be improved with a more difffuse light source to soften the shadow.<br/>I think you''ll get plenty of questions as to how you did the ³ in the title!</td>', 'Nice crisp contrasty image. I think it cold be improved with a more difffuse light source to soften the shadow.I think you''ll get plenty of questions as to how you did the ³ in the title!', '2003-12-13 23:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(512462, 49439, 1031, '<td valign="top">I have a shot of something like this .. they have both great shapes and textures.</td>', 'I have a shot of something like this .. they have both great shapes and textures.', '2003-12-13 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(512464, 49897, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great timing! The contour of the icicle leads the eye to the drops, which are beautifully shaped. Nice color too.</td>', 'Great timing! The contour of the icicle leads the eye to the drops, which are beautifully shaped. Nice color too.', '2003-12-13 23:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(512471, 49758, 10402, '<td valign="top">The contrast with the circular objects really shows off the shape of the egg. But the lack of a shadow and the bright edge of the egg makes it seem flat, almost "cut out". Indeed, my first impression was of a cylinder with a strange shaped hole before my mind registered the subtle shading and texture of the egg.</td>', 'The contrast with the circular objects really shows off the shape of the egg. But the lack of a shadow and the bright edge of the egg makes it seem flat, almost "cut out". Indeed, my first impression was of a cylinder with a strange shaped hole before my mind registered the subtle shading and texture of the egg.', '2003-12-13 23:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(512474, 49928, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting shows the shape well and also casts nice shadows. The white border is very distracting so close to the one string.</td>', 'The lighting shows the shape well and also casts nice shadows. The white border is very distracting so close to the one string.', '2003-12-13 23:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(512476, 49851, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the tracks stand out nicely and also brings out the interesting texture of the snow.</td>', 'The lighting makes the tracks stand out nicely and also brings out the interesting texture of the snow.', '2003-12-13 23:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(512501, 49525, 14952, '<td valign="top">bottom of a sneaker?</td>', 'bottom of a sneaker?', '2003-12-14 00:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(512558, 49872, 7106, '<td valign="top">It looks very grainy to me</td>', 'It looks very grainy to me', '2003-12-14 04:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(512560, 49639, 7106, '<td valign="top">I think that cropping the foreground out of this may have made it look better. The unfocused part in the front draws my attention.</td>', 'I think that cropping the foreground out of this may have made it look better. The unfocused part in the front draws my attention.', '2003-12-14 04:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(512561, 49908, 7106, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing a bus went by?</td>', 'I''m guessing a bus went by?', '2003-12-14 04:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(512594, 49960, 14913, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot, mostly because its very graphic and I think that is an exellent way to show a shape. Plus it´s just very cool.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot, mostly because its very graphic and I think that is an exellent way to show a shape. Plus it´s just very cool.', '2003-12-14 08:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(512631, 49624, 2553, '<td valign="top">The soft background makes the shapes of the droplets stand out nicely, and the way the drops are lined up along the curved edge creates interest, and keeps the eye moving throughout the composition.  I like the concept. 8</td>', 'The soft background makes the shapes of the droplets stand out nicely, and the way the drops are lined up along the curved edge creates interest, and keeps the eye moving throughout the composition.  I like the concept. 8', '2003-12-14 10:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(512635, 49908, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition, and the "excitement" that seems to emanate from this shot.  A lively and interesting shot. 8</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition, and the "excitement" that seems to emanate from this shot.  A lively and interesting shot. 8', '2003-12-14 10:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(512636, 49947, 2553, '<td valign="top">Has kind of an advertising feel to it.  I like the soft focus too, it suits this shot well.  There are both "shapes" and "forms" in the shot, but the combination makes it interesting.  The colors are lovely, as is the lighting you chose.</td>', 'Has kind of an advertising feel to it.  I like the soft focus too, it suits this shot well.  There are both "shapes" and "forms" in the shot, but the combination makes it interesting.  The colors are lovely, as is the lighting you chose.', '2003-12-14 10:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(512639, 49876, 2553, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot would  be a combination of shape and form, but the simplicity of the shot makes it work.  Black and white is a perfect choice for the presentation of the subject, and I like that you did not overwhelm it with a huge border.</td>', 'To me, this shot would  be a combination of shape and form, but the simplicity of the shot makes it work.  Black and white is a perfect choice for the presentation of the subject, and I like that you did not overwhelm it with a huge border.', '2003-12-14 10:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(512643, 49962, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the nice warm tone of the shot.  The composition is lacking for me.  I think the use of two rings would have created better dynamics for the composition.  This ring looks lonely sitting down there in the corner all by itself. But, I guess if you go by the title, that''s exactly what it wants.</td>', 'I like the nice warm tone of the shot.  The composition is lacking for me.  I think the use of two rings would have created better dynamics for the composition.  This ring looks lonely sitting down there in the corner all by itself. But, I guess if you go by the title, that''s exactly what it wants.', '2003-12-14 10:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(512644, 49949, 2553, '<td valign="top">An altogether lovely shot, with nice composition and beautiful lighting.  I would love to be able to see just the hint of the stem to anchor the flower a little more.  A good combination of shapes, forms and textures.</td>', 'An altogether lovely shot, with nice composition and beautiful lighting.  I would love to be able to see just the hint of the stem to anchor the flower a little more.  A good combination of shapes, forms and textures.', '2003-12-14 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(512646, 49897, 2553, '<td valign="top">I find the wide border to be a bit overwhelming - my eyes are continuously drawn away from the subject to the white of the border.  I would like to have seen the entire icicle in nice sharp focus.  The composition is interesting.  Good catch on those droplets!</td>', 'I find the wide border to be a bit overwhelming - my eyes are continuously drawn away from the subject to the white of the border.  I would like to have seen the entire icicle in nice sharp focus.  The composition is interesting.  Good catch on those droplets!', '2003-12-14 10:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(512649, 49923, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and focus,  and the simple presentation, but the composition lacks interest for me.</td>', 'I like the lighting and focus,  and the simple presentation, but the composition lacks interest for me.', '2003-12-14 10:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(512651, 49938, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the "feel" of the shot, but it is a bit dark for me.  The composition is interesting, and I like the angle of the light that creates the highlights.</td>', 'I like the concept and the "feel" of the shot, but it is a bit dark for me.  The composition is interesting, and I like the angle of the light that creates the highlights.', '2003-12-14 10:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(512654, 49826, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m glad I came back to this again.  The composition is very nice, especially in relation to the light source.  I would probably find this shot to be appropriate for shape, form, and texture!  Lots of visual interest here, with the repetition of shape and form constantly drawing the eye throughout the shot.</td>', 'I''m glad I came back to this again.  The composition is very nice, especially in relation to the light source.  I would probably find this shot to be appropriate for shape, form, and texture!  Lots of visual interest here, with the repetition of shape and form constantly drawing the eye throughout the shot.', '2003-12-14 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(512657, 49967, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though this is interesting to look at in an abstract way, it does not hold my interest.  The combination of colors and the simple presentation are nice, but overall has moderate impact for me.</td>', 'Though this is interesting to look at in an abstract way, it does not hold my interest.  The combination of colors and the simple presentation are nice, but overall has moderate impact for me.', '2003-12-14 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(512660, 49704, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very cool shape.  I love the gold shadow.</td>', 'Very cool shape.  I love the gold shadow.', '2003-12-14 10:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(512676, 49979, 5999, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Like the lighting and noise effect. The way the woman reflects the shape of the guitar is a lovely touch.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Nicely done. Like the lighting and noise effect. The way the woman reflects the shape of the guitar is a lovely touch.Mark', '2003-12-14 10:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(512677, 49525, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL  A bribe for votes???  Just kiding!  I got no clue anyways!</td>', 'LOL  A bribe for votes???  Just kiding!  I got no clue anyways!', '2003-12-14 10:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(512678, 49970, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is VERY busy.  This really detracts from the shape being a dominant part of picture.  Focus is good as are the colors.  If there weren''t so many elements it would be much better though.<br/>TC<br/>PS.  I see you ;-)</td>', 'This shot is VERY busy.  This really detracts from the shape being a dominant part of picture.  Focus is good as are the colors.  If there weren''t so many elements it would be much better though.TCPS.  I see you ;-)', '2003-12-14 11:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(512679, 49960, 5999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Crop may be a little tight at the back and bottom of the shoe. Overall a wonderful silhouette.<br/>Mark<br/></td>', 'Beautiful. Crop may be a little tight at the back and bottom of the shoe. Overall a wonderful silhouette.Mark', '2003-12-14 11:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(512681, 49469, 5999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Lighting seems a bit harsh though. Perhaps a reflector of some kind to lighten some of the really dark shadows.</td>', 'Nice shot. Lighting seems a bit harsh though. Perhaps a reflector of some kind to lighten some of the really dark shadows.', '2003-12-14 11:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(512683, 49904, 5999, '<td valign="top">Great. Like the repeating shapes! Good lighting, nice detail.<br/>Mark</td>', 'Great. Like the repeating shapes! Good lighting, nice detail.Mark', '2003-12-14 11:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(512686, 49964, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It could use a bit more DOF IMHO.  Also, I think it would work better as a geometric/abstract shot (shape) if the background elements weren''t there on the left, as well as the detail in the floor.</td>', 'Nice shot.  It could use a bit more DOF IMHO.  Also, I think it would work better as a geometric/abstract shot (shape) if the background elements weren''t there on the left, as well as the detail in the floor.', '2003-12-14 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(512687, 49888, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good subject and good lighting/exposure/details.  I think the composition here is distracting though.  Why the vertical crop, especially with the left corner and the shadow cropped, yet so much space at the top?  Following the rule of thirds is fine, but I don''t think the crop works here.</td>', 'A good subject and good lighting/exposure/details.  I think the composition here is distracting though.  Why the vertical crop, especially with the left corner and the shadow cropped, yet so much space at the top?  Following the rule of thirds is fine, but I don''t think the crop works here.', '2003-12-14 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(512692, 49904, 12253, '<td valign="top">A nice geometric study of shape.  Not sure about the inclusion of the egg with the burnt edges though.  Maybe soft boiled would have been better here.  Also, the directional light is good, but a bit strong and overexposed in the upper right.  But overall, I think it has good aesthetics, and you have an artistic eye.</td>', 'A nice geometric study of shape.  Not sure about the inclusion of the egg with the burnt edges though.  Maybe soft boiled would have been better here.  Also, the directional light is good, but a bit strong and overexposed in the upper right.  But overall, I think it has good aesthetics, and you have an artistic eye.', '2003-12-14 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(512693, 49988, 12253, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea and good pattern study.  I find the lighting you chose works against this though.  The overexposed areas are distracting, and yet many of the other areas of the glass are too dark.  Actually, if I hold a sheet of paper over the left 1/3 or more where most of the overexposed area is, it looks like that might have been a good crop.</td>', 'An interesting idea and good pattern study.  I find the lighting you chose works against this though.  The overexposed areas are distracting, and yet many of the other areas of the glass are too dark.  Actually, if I hold a sheet of paper over the left 1/3 or more where most of the overexposed area is, it looks like that might have been a good crop.', '2003-12-14 11:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(512694, 49704, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.   I think it would have been good to shoot from a higher perspective than here, so you have a bit more of the real fork.  I showed this to someone and I had to point out that the shadow was actually a shadow.  If the real fork wasn''t shot from the edge only, there would also be a complementary symmetry.</td>', 'Nice effect.   I think it would have been good to shoot from a higher perspective than here, so you have a bit more of the real fork.  I showed this to someone and I had to point out that the shadow was actually a shadow.  If the real fork wasn''t shot from the edge only, there would also be a complementary symmetry.', '2003-12-14 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(512696, 49910, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  A 10 from me, and one of my top choices.  Slight overexposure on the white area background top, but not significant.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  A 10 from me, and one of my top choices.  Slight overexposure on the white area background top, but not significant.', '2003-12-14 11:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(512697, 49826, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, and good for the challenge.  My choice for the blue ribbon.  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful image, and good for the challenge.  My choice for the blue ribbon.  Good luck.', '2003-12-14 11:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(512698, 49914, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the layout here and your very nice design.  I wonder how this might have looked without the overexposure in the center background?   I think a natural looking background would have been better.<br/></td>', 'I like the layout here and your very nice design.  I wonder how this might have looked without the overexposure in the center background?   I think a natural looking background would have been better.', '2003-12-14 11:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(512700, 49783, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot; Not a criticism, but I think the colors and textures are more salient and more the focus of this shot than the shapes.</td>', 'Very nice shot; Not a criticism, but I think the colors and textures are more salient and more the focus of this shot than the shapes.', '2003-12-14 11:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(512702, 49965, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good one, it made me laugh!  Then I looked in the mirror.... :( <br/> <br/>Aesthetically/Compositionally, I think if you had caught more to the left of him, where his shirt is off the frame and put him on the right, it would have been stronger.</td>', 'Good one, it made me laugh!  Then I looked in the mirror.... :(  Aesthetically/Compositionally, I think if you had caught more to the left of him, where his shirt is off the frame and put him on the right, it would have been stronger.', '2003-12-14 11:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(512703, 49625, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot and use of DOF.  I think this would have been nice in color or toned to go with the rust theme.   Also, it would have been good to try to avoid the darker background detail at the bottom perhaps by shooting upward a bit more.  Then you might have even included the top of the wider arc.</td>', 'Good shot and use of DOF.  I think this would have been nice in color or toned to go with the rust theme.   Also, it would have been good to try to avoid the darker background detail at the bottom perhaps by shooting upward a bit more.  Then you might have even included the top of the wider arc.', '2003-12-14 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(512704, 49971, 12253, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I think this meets the challenge, and with some flare, but the emphasis here to me is color, not shape!</td>', 'Pretty.  I think this meets the challenge, and with some flare, but the emphasis here to me is color, not shape!', '2003-12-14 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(512707, 49923, 10625, '<td valign="top">cool.  sweet border, excellent job minimizing the shadow.  9</td>', 'cool.  sweet border, excellent job minimizing the shadow.  9', '2003-12-14 12:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(512709, 49981, 11843, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cloned out the little fuzzies on the ends of these straws or tubes. It is allowed and would have put this image over the top for me.</td>', 'I think I would have cloned out the little fuzzies on the ends of these straws or tubes. It is allowed and would have put this image over the top for me.', '2003-12-14 12:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(512745, 49762, 7628, '<td valign="top">the silouettes acheive a nice shape effect.  I like the contract between the regular roofline and the windmill.  While it is good to have the sky bright and less detailed so you focus on the shapes, I''d like to see a bit more contract and color.</td>', 'the silouettes acheive a nice shape effect.  I like the contract between the regular roofline and the windmill.  While it is good to have the sky bright and less detailed so you focus on the shapes, I''d like to see a bit more contract and color.', '2003-12-14 13:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(512746, 49732, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesteing pattern, repetition.  I like the bright pink contrast with the scratchy silver.In spots the lighting is a bit blow out, and the focus isn''t as sharp as I''d like.</td>', 'Interesteing pattern, repetition.  I like the bright pink contrast with the scratchy silver.In spots the lighting is a bit blow out, and the focus isn''t as sharp as I''d like.', '2003-12-14 13:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(512747, 49896, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice study in whites.  You have gotten a nice sculpted look with minimal range. The effect definitely emphasizes shape.  Spot on the top between ear and eye is so bright, I can bearly see a separatrion between the knight and the white background (if at all) Just a slight adjustment in lighting or exposure would righ that. I''d like to see another pic done of a black knight on a black background and matte the two together (after the competition naturally!) 8</td>', 'Nice study in whites.  You have gotten a nice sculpted look with minimal range. The effect definitely emphasizes shape.  Spot on the top between ear and eye is so bright, I can bearly see a separatrion between the knight and the white background (if at all) Just a slight adjustment in lighting or exposure would righ that. I''d like to see another pic done of a black knight on a black background and matte the two together (after the competition naturally!) 8', '2003-12-14 13:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(512749, 49851, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny title - an inventive way of saying "wabbit twacks!" It is hard to get the exposure right in the snow, and you''ve done a nice job - I like the subtle shading and shapiong of the snow around the tracks.  Some spots are a bit blown out - the sunny side of the track wall, but no big deal.  I like the vertical composition, perhaps a diagonal would be a tad bit more dynamic.  Seems like ti could be sharper too.</td>', 'Funny title - an inventive way of saying "wabbit twacks!" It is hard to get the exposure right in the snow, and you''ve done a nice job - I like the subtle shading and shapiong of the snow around the tracks.  Some spots are a bit blown out - the sunny side of the track wall, but no big deal.  I like the vertical composition, perhaps a diagonal would be a tad bit more dynamic.  Seems like ti could be sharper too.', '2003-12-14 13:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(512750, 49803, 7628, '<td valign="top">Our forst experiences with shapes.  A good idea.  I like the spotlight too - metaphore for how a child will focus on one toy. one task.  Perhaps a close-up of the top of the box, with the holes and shapes starting to fit though would be a more cohesive image - more "focused."  I like the shape of the holes.  The "cage" of shapes below is a bit jumbled and hard to see, ittakes away from the strong image of the top of the box.</td>', 'Our forst experiences with shapes.  A good idea.  I like the spotlight too - metaphore for how a child will focus on one toy. one task.  Perhaps a close-up of the top of the box, with the holes and shapes starting to fit though would be a more cohesive image - more "focused."  I like the shape of the holes.  The "cage" of shapes below is a bit jumbled and hard to see, ittakes away from the strong image of the top of the box.', '2003-12-14 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(512754, 49984, 7628, '<td valign="top">this subject has nice texture, and you;ve captured the detail nicely - gives an emphasis to the shape of it.  Nice framing, nice b&amp;w.  Wish ear were a bit sharper. 8</td>', 'this subject has nice texture, and you;ve captured the detail nicely - gives an emphasis to the shape of it.  Nice framing, nice b&w.  Wish ear were a bit sharper. 8', '2003-12-14 13:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(512755, 49936, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very festive shape.  I like yor use of DOF - the front bit is nice and sharp the back ones are  out of focus enough so as not to destract or confuse the shape of the the front piece, but they give a nice background - th elight on the sparkles gove nice bubbles of light.</td>', 'A very festive shape.  I like yor use of DOF - the front bit is nice and sharp the back ones are  out of focus enough so as not to destract or confuse the shape of the the front piece, but they give a nice background - th elight on the sparkles gove nice bubbles of light.', '2003-12-14 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(512757, 49987, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  At first the blue seeems like a frame - then you see the subtle texture and the elbow over the edge and realize it in real.  Nice way to include shape, make it your subject while having aperson as a subject.  I like the way the background too. 9</td>', 'This is a great idea.  At first the blue seeems like a frame - then you see the subtle texture and the elbow over the edge and realize it in real.  Nice way to include shape, make it your subject while having aperson as a subject.  I like the way the background too. 9', '2003-12-14 13:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(512758, 49704, 6714, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot.  :)  Very impressive!</td>', 'This is an excellent shot.  :)  Very impressive!', '2003-12-14 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(512759, 49971, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the blue backlight - how it catches the edges of the shell - wish the left hand side had the same highlights.  The yellow center has a great glow - is the shell that smooth and uniformly colored on the inside - it feels like the light has washed out the details.</td>', 'I like the blue backlight - how it catches the edges of the shell - wish the left hand side had the same highlights.  The yellow center has a great glow - is the shell that smooth and uniformly colored on the inside - it feels like the light has washed out the details.', '2003-12-14 13:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(512760, 49883, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like this composition - the kilns moving into the background, the colors, red green and blue.  Nice clouds too.  9</td>', 'I like this composition - the kilns moving into the background, the colors, red green and blue.  Nice clouds too.  9', '2003-12-14 13:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(512762, 49854, 7628, '<td valign="top">Egill? I enjoyed seeing this as contract to the moon subjects in this challenge.  The way the light picks out his head and the mike is very dramatic, but also a bit funny.  A nice portait. You''ve gotten great detail and focus in the light spots, I like the predominance of the blackness - gives a feeling of perfomance. 9</td>', 'Egill? I enjoyed seeing this as contract to the moon subjects in this challenge.  The way the light picks out his head and the mike is very dramatic, but also a bit funny.  A nice portait. You''ve gotten great detail and focus in the light spots, I like the predominance of the blackness - gives a feeling of perfomance. 9', '2003-12-14 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(512769, 49704, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a very eye-catching effect!  Makes you question your eyes - what is the object what is the shadow?  Makes you think about how light effects our perception of shape.  I wonder how a slightly different angle to the composition would work - more diagonal? I love the gentle range of tones inthe shadow. 9</td>', 'This is a very eye-catching effect!  Makes you question your eyes - what is the object what is the shadow?  Makes you think about how light effects our perception of shape.  I wonder how a slightly different angle to the composition would work - more diagonal? I love the gentle range of tones inthe shadow. 9', '2003-12-14 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(512770, 49910, 7628, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this very much.  A similar take on shape as the fork shadow picture - the shape of the light is transformed from 3 dimensions to 2.  I also like the texture of the wall and the bright diamond shape framing the light. 9</td>', 'I enjoy this very much.  A similar take on shape as the fork shadow picture - the shape of the light is transformed from 3 dimensions to 2.  I also like the texture of the wall and the bright diamond shape framing the light. 9', '2003-12-14 14:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(512785, 49802, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like the added stars. Impossible shot in reality. 7</td>', 'I like the added stars. Impossible shot in reality. 7', '2003-12-14 14:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
