(512838, 49540, 8860, '<td valign="top">What incredible atmosphere - a great take on the challenge. Wonderful lighting and those birds add a great sense of man vs nature. I can''t quite decide what would have improved this at the bottom, but it''s not quite right (too little / not enough?). No matter though - it''s a winner.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-15 05:00:17.</i></td>', 'What incredible atmosphere - a great take on the challenge. Wonderful lighting and those birds add a great sense of man vs nature. I can''t quite decide what would have improved this at the bottom, but it''s not quite right (too little / not enough?). No matter though - it''s a winner.', '2003-12-14 17:19:02.000000', '2003-12-15 05:00:17.000000', 1),
(512840, 49897, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. Good colour, nice DOF and my favoured kind of shape. Those drops almost give your set-up away but not quite! Very cool shot!  ;)</td>', 'Lovely capture. Good colour, nice DOF and my favoured kind of shape. Those drops almost give your set-up away but not quite! Very cool shot!  ;)', '2003-12-14 17:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
