(512975, 49921, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and the desaturation you''ve achieved.  What I think would have really improved this photo is catching her on the way in to the frame rather than the way out.    The crop and execution is otherwise excellent.  There is still a bit of blue iin the background which would have been nice to get rid of but I understand it''s tricky while following the rules!</td>', 'I like this idea, and the desaturation you''ve achieved.  What I think would have really improved this photo is catching her on the way in to the frame rather than the way out.    The crop and execution is otherwise excellent.  There is still a bit of blue iin the background which would have been nice to get rid of but I understand it''s tricky while following the rules!', '2003-12-14 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
