(513250, 49525, 3306, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who took a guess or commented on my picture. Im sorry that nobody was able to guess the correct answer.  Judging from the score, I guess it wasnt a very good picture so I am probably somewhat to blame.  Either that or you all are not making it in to your friendly dentist to get your teeth cleaned at least twice a year as you should!  I hope everyone took this little exercise in the manner in which it was intended. That was, to have some fun and get people to look just a little longer at my picture. In the spirit of good will, for all those who did comment, please email to me your address and I will send you a free (unused) toothbrush! Thanks again to everyone for taking the time to comment and play the game.:)</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who took a guess or commented on my picture. Im sorry that nobody was able to guess the correct answer.  Judging from the score, I guess it wasnt a very good picture so I am probably somewhat to blame.  Either that or you all are not making it in to your friendly dentist to get your teeth cleaned at least twice a year as you should!  I hope everyone took this little exercise in the manner in which it was intended. That was, to have some fun and get people to look just a little longer at my picture. In the spirit of good will, for all those who did comment, please email to me your address and I will send you a free (unused) toothbrush! Thanks again to everyone for taking the time to comment and play the game.:)', '2003-12-15 00:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
