(513273, 49923, 6035, '<td valign="top">the only problem with your comment was that i see cloned apples :) how many original apples were there? nice shot otherwise, but i could easily tell they were cloned :) (left one with the bottom right one, and top left one with the right one, didn''t really have the time to look closer than that :P )</td>', 'the only problem with your comment was that i see cloned apples :) how many original apples were there? nice shot otherwise, but i could easily tell they were cloned :) (left one with the bottom right one, and top left one with the right one, didn''t really have the time to look closer than that :P )', '2003-12-15 00:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
