(513433, 49826, 3585, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thanks to all, this was a real suprise, and a good one! Before the vote I was wondering if this picture was not going to be considered off topic or confusing...as often.<br/>This was taken on the Mediterranean coast after the terrible floods we have had in this region. Water slowly oozing back to the sea.<br/> <br/>I have a few new water-related pitures on my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=3585" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">profile page.</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-15 05:31:48.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all, this was a real suprise, and a good one! Before the vote I was wondering if this picture was not going to be considered off topic or confusing...as often.This was taken on the Mediterranean coast after the terrible floods we have had in this region. Water slowly oozing back to the sea. I have a few new water-related pitures on my profile page.', '2003-12-15 05:08:23.000000', '2003-12-15 05:31:48.000000', 0),
