(513735, 49727, 14509, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Being such a young photographer, you are already on the road to success.  Well done!   Keep up the GREAT work.<br/> <br/>P.S. I wish I was as good as you. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations! Being such a young photographer, you are already on the road to success.  Well done!   Keep up the GREAT work. P.S. I wish I was as good as you.  ', '2003-12-15 12:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(513736, 49727, 12223, '<td valign="top">A couple of notables on this picture.  1). the height of the lens was spot on.....as the glass rim heights are all equal.  2). the duplication of the primary color from the photo, in the 3 pixel border sandwiched between the 2 black borders, works very well. I am quite a fan of this particular process of bordering.  Good job.</td>', 'A couple of notables on this picture.  1). the height of the lens was spot on.....as the glass rim heights are all equal.  2). the duplication of the primary color from the photo, in the 3 pixel border sandwiched between the 2 black borders, works very well. I am quite a fan of this particular process of bordering.  Good job.', '2003-12-15 12:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(513799, 49826, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOOHOO!! My top!!! Félicitation! :-D</td>', 'WOOHOO!! My top!!! Félicitation! :-D', '2003-12-15 13:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(513816, 49826, 5391, '<td valign="top">Congratulations to the artist and craftsman.  You are an inspiration!</td>', 'Congratulations to the artist and craftsman.  You are an inspiration!', '2003-12-15 14:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(513817, 49826, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, JJ, you''re back in top form!  Congratulations.</td>', 'Hey, JJ, you''re back in top form!  Congratulations.', '2003-12-15 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(513818, 49727, 5112, '<td valign="top">CONGRATULATIONS!  Excellent work.</td>', 'CONGRATULATIONS!  Excellent work.', '2003-12-15 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(513827, 49725, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  It gives the feeling of being an older photograph.  The only things I would change, would be to lighten it a bit.  It is a bit too dark for me.  I also think that maybe you could''ve taken the angle a bit differently... either focusing more on the person in the cockpit, or the tail end.  There are a few different subjects in the picture.  I would''ve broke it up and focused on one or the other.  If you were going for the star for the shapes challenge, maybe you could''ve focused more on the star and had the rest of the plane in the background.  Just my $.02 :)</td>', 'This is a great photo.  It gives the feeling of being an older photograph.  The only things I would change, would be to lighten it a bit.  It is a bit too dark for me.  I also think that maybe you could''ve taken the angle a bit differently... either focusing more on the person in the cockpit, or the tail end.  There are a few different subjects in the picture.  I would''ve broke it up and focused on one or the other.  If you were going for the star for the shapes challenge, maybe you could''ve focused more on the star and had the rest of the plane in the background.  Just my $.02 :)', '2003-12-15 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(513828, 49989, 14837, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this image.  Although, I would''ve tried to get an angle of the image without the trees in the background.  You have 2 focal points here.  You have the odd shapes in the front, but you also have the trees in the back.  Just the front shape with the clouds and sky behind it would''ve cut out the excess.  Try to pick your subject and focus on that...</td>', 'Nice colors in this image.  Although, I would''ve tried to get an angle of the image without the trees in the background.  You have 2 focal points here.  You have the odd shapes in the front, but you also have the trees in the back.  Just the front shape with the clouds and sky behind it would''ve cut out the excess.  Try to pick your subject and focus on that...', '2003-12-15 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(513844, 49872, 8860, '<td valign="top">Those who suggest this is perversion - I''d ask, is this not the appreciation of the female form from a personal perspective? It''s tongue-in-cheek or crass maybe, but not perverse.  ;)</td>', 'Those who suggest this is perversion - I''d ask, is this not the appreciation of the female form from a personal perspective? It''s tongue-in-cheek or crass maybe, but not perverse.  ;)', '2003-12-15 14:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(513879, 49936, 472, '<td valign="top">i think this should have placed much higher.</td>', 'i think this should have placed much higher.', '2003-12-15 15:44:48.000000', NULL, 0);
